</math> yields <math alttext="7 left parenthesis StartFraction r Over 4 EndFraction plus 5 right parenthesis plus 6 y equals 5"><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, or <math alttext="left parenthesis StartFraction 7 r Over 4 EndFraction plus 35 right parenthesis plus 6 y equals 5"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>. Subtracting <math alttext="left parenthesis StartFraction 7 r Over 4 EndFraction plus 35 right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> from each side of this equation yields <math alttext="6 y equals minus StartFraction 7 r Over 4 EndFraction minus 35 plus 5"><mn>6</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, or <math alttext="6 y equals minus StartFraction 7 r Over 4 EndFraction minus 30"><mrow>
<mrow>
<mn>6</mn>
<mi>y</mi>
</mrow>
<mo>=</mo>
<mrow>
<mrow>
<mo>-</mo>
<mfrac>
<mrow>
<mn>7</mn>
<mi>r</mi>
</mrow>
<mn>4</mn>
</mfrac>
</mrow>
<mo>-</mo>
<mn>30</mn>
</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>. Dividing each side of this equation by <math alttext="6"><mn>6</mn>
</math> yields <math alttext="y equals minus StartFraction 7 r Over 24 EndFraction minus 5"><mrow>
<mi>y</mi>
<mo>=</mo>
<mrow>
